{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beatfinder is a fast, simple-to-pick-up rhythm runner.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll jump, slide, and kick your way across rooftops, dodging obstacles and knocking out cultists, all while staying in sync with the music. Each track is its own handcrafted level. Every jump and punch timed just right to keep you in the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/a1620a189581ebfc9a7ffbba79e7b541.poster.avif?t=1759859967\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/a1620a189581ebfc9a7ffbba79e7b541.webm?t=1759859967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/a1620a189581ebfc9a7ffbba79e7b541.mp4?t=1759859967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch </strong>enemies that stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/29c0c5023bbbcaebb83667e39c35dd99.poster.avif?t=1759859967\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/29c0c5023bbbcaebb83667e39c35dd99.webm?t=1759859967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/29c0c5023bbbcaebb83667e39c35dd99.mp4?t=1759859967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide</strong> under obstacles with style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_pa